-- חוזר לבעלויות תש"פ/3 (3.2.2020): עדכון תוספת שקלית 2016 לעובדי הוראה
-- בחטיבה העליונה ובכיתות יג'-יד' ועדכון תוספת 87' מעבר לרפורמה למנהלים
-- בעוז לתמורה.
-- The index-linked "shekel supplement 2016" for upper-secondary teachers
-- from 1.1.2020, and the principals' '87 transition supplement.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common
IMPORT daydate

§ `תש"פ/3 עדכון תוספת שקלית 2016 בחטיבה העליונה ותוספת 87' למנהלים`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, date, reference number, addressee, greeting and subject line; no rule.

@desc A teaching employee as far as this circular asks about him or her.
DECLARE `upper-secondary employee` HAS
    `graded on the teaching-employee scale`        IS A BOOLEAN @desc graded in the teaching employees' grading (דירוג עובדי הוראה)
    `employed by an owner of a supervised institution` IS A BOOLEAN @desc employed by an owning body of an institution the Ministry of Education supervises
    `employed in upper secondary or grades 13-14`  IS A BOOLEAN @desc employed in the upper-secondary division (חטיבה עליונה) or in grades 13-14
    `employed under Oz LeTmura`                    IS A BOOLEAN @desc employed on the terms of the Oz LeTmura reform
    `is a principal`                               IS A BOOLEAN @desc a school principal (מנהל)

§§ `Index linkage and its purpose`

-- The circular rests on the wage agreements of 14.3.2018 (§5(a)(b), §5(b)(b))
-- and 23.3.2017 (§4(d)), and on earlier circulars תשע"ז/4, תשע"ח/5 and
-- תשע"ט/3; none of them is in this file. The supplement's payment rules
-- (who is paid it, pro-rating) come from those instruments.
@ref akn:preamble/p13 akn:preamble/p14
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the shekel supplement 2016 is linked to the consumer price index` IS TRUE

@desc The consumer price index for a month, as published; an input of this file.
ASSUME `consumer price index for` IS A FUNCTION FROM DATE TO NUMBER

-- ¶15–16: the update is for the period from 1.1.2020, and the linkage is the
-- December 2019 index (published January 2020) against December 2018's.
@ref akn:preamble/p15
`the period this circular updates begins` MEANS Date 1 1 2020

@ref akn:preamble/p16
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the linkage factor` IS
    `consumer price index for` (Date 1 12 2019)
    DIVIDED BY `consumer price index for` (Date 1 12 2018)

§§ `Applicability`

@ref akn:preamble/p17 akn:preamble/p18 akn:preamble/p19
GIVEN e IS AN `upper-secondary employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the circular applies to` e IF
        e's `graded on the teaching-employee scale`
    AND e's `employed by an owner of a supervised institution`
    AND e's `employed in upper secondary or grades 13-14`
-- ¶19: Oz LeTmura and non-reform employees alike, so the reform is not a condition.

§§ `א. Updating the shekel supplement 2016`


-- Which of the two printed amounts an employee takes. ¶3's group is
-- "teachers not in Oz LeTmura AND principals", so a principal takes the
-- lower amount even under Oz LeTmura.
DECLARE `supplement group` IS ONE OF
    `Oz LeTmura teacher`
    `non-reform teacher or principal`

GIVEN e IS AN `upper-secondary employee`
GIVETH A `supplement group`
DECIDE `the supplement group of` e IS
    IF e's `employed under Oz LeTmura` AND NOT e's `is a principal`
    THEN `Oz LeTmura teacher`
    ELSE `non-reform teacher or principal`

-- The amounts are per month, as printed, with the dates they take effect.
-- The 1.1.2020 amounts replace what was paid for that period ("במקום … כפי
-- ששולם בגין אותה תקופה"), so they are owed retroactively.
@ref akn:art_a/p1 akn:art_a/p2 akn:art_a/p3 akn:art_a/p4 akn:art_a/p5 akn:art_a/p6
GIVEN g IS A `supplement group`, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `monthly shekel supplement 2016` g d IS
    CONSIDER g
    WHEN `Oz LeTmura teacher` THEN
        BRANCH IF d AT LEAST Date 1 9 2020 THEN JUST 1282.69
               IF d AT LEAST Date 1 1 2020 THEN JUST 1242.05
               OTHERWISE NOTHING
    WHEN `non-reform teacher or principal` THEN
        BRANCH IF d AT LEAST Date 1 9 2020 THEN JUST 1065.83
               IF d AT LEAST Date 1 1 2020 THEN JUST 1025.19
               OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- What had been paid for 1.1.2020–31.8.2020, as the circular states it.
@ref akn:art_a/p2 akn:art_a/p3
GIVEN g IS A `supplement group`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `amount paid before this update` g IS
    CONSIDER g
    WHEN `Oz LeTmura teacher`               THEN 1153.84
    WHEN `non-reform teacher or principal`  THEN 938.27

GIVEN g IS A `supplement group`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `monthly difference owed for January to August 2020` g IS
    CONSIDER `monthly shekel supplement 2016` g (Date 1 1 2020)
    WHEN JUST a THEN a MINUS `amount paid before this update` g
    WHEN NOTHING THEN 0

-- The amounts for 1.1.2020 are not the earlier ones times one linkage
-- factor (Oz LeTmura +7.6%, the other group +9.3%, part ב's supplement
-- +0.6%): ¶14 says the supplement is paid in several steps, and the circular
-- does not show which step of the agreements makes up the rest. The amounts
-- are therefore encoded as data, never derived.

DECLARE `supplement action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the updated supplement` HAS `amount paid` IS A NUMBER
    `reimburse the owner`        HAS `through` IS A `reimbursement route`

DECLARE `reimbursement route` IS ONE OF
    `in the cost of the relevant hour in the payments system`
    `in the payments system under topic 558`

GIVEN e IS AN `upper-secondary employee`, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `supplement action`
DECIDE `paying the updated supplement` e d IS
    CONSIDER `monthly shekel supplement 2016` (`the supplement group of` e) d
    WHEN JUST a THEN
        IF `the circular applies to` e
        THEN PARTY `the employer`
             MUST  `pay the updated supplement` `amount paid`
                   PROVIDED `amount paid` AT LEAST a
             LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "תש\"פ/3 part א: the shekel supplement 2016 is paid at the updated amount"
        ELSE FULFILLED
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FULFILLED

@ref akn:art_a/p7
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `supplement action`
DECIDE `reimbursing the owners for the supplement` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `reimburse the owner` `in the cost of the relevant hour in the payments system`
    LEST BREACH BY `the Ministry of Education` BECAUSE "תש\"פ/3 part א: the owners are reimbursed in the cost of the relevant hour"

§§ `ב. The '87 transition supplement for principals in Oz LeTmura`


-- ¶1 rests on §18 of circular תשע"ח/9, which is not in this file.
@ref akn:art_b/p1
GIVEN e IS AN `upper-secondary employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the '87 transition supplement` e IF
        `the circular applies to` e
    AND e's `is a principal`
    AND e's `employed under Oz LeTmura`

@ref akn:art_b/p2
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `monthly '87 transition supplement` d IS
    IF d AT LEAST Date 1 1 2020
    THEN JUST 1024.73
    ELSE NOTHING

`the '87 supplement paid before this update` MEANS 1018.62

@ref akn:art_b/p3
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `supplement action`
DECIDE `reimbursing the owners for the '87 supplement` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `reimburse the owner` `in the payments system under topic 558`
    LEST BREACH BY `the Ministry of Education` BECAUSE "תש\"פ/3 part ב: the owners are reimbursed under payments topic 558"

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off, signatures and copies list; no rule.

-- Examples.
`an Oz LeTmura teacher` MEANS
    `upper-secondary employee` WITH
        `graded on the teaching-employee scale`            IS TRUE
        `employed by an owner of a supervised institution` IS TRUE
        `employed in upper secondary or grades 13-14`      IS TRUE
        `employed under Oz LeTmura`                        IS TRUE
        `is a principal`                                   IS FALSE

`an Oz LeTmura principal` MEANS
    `upper-secondary employee` WITH
        `graded on the teaching-employee scale`            IS TRUE
        `employed by an owner of a supervised institution` IS TRUE
        `employed in upper secondary or grades 13-14`      IS TRUE
        `employed under Oz LeTmura`                        IS TRUE
        `is a principal`                                   IS TRUE

`a junior-high teacher` MEANS
    `upper-secondary employee` WITH
        `graded on the teaching-employee scale`            IS TRUE
        `employed by an owner of a supervised institution` IS TRUE
        `employed in upper secondary or grades 13-14`      IS FALSE
        `employed under Oz LeTmura`                        IS FALSE
        `is a principal`                                   IS FALSE

#ASSERT `the circular applies to` `an Oz LeTmura teacher`
#ASSERT NOT `the circular applies to` `a junior-high teacher`
#ASSERT `monthly shekel supplement 2016` (`the supplement group of` `an Oz LeTmura teacher`) (Date 1 3 2020) EQUALS JUST 1242.05
#ASSERT `monthly shekel supplement 2016` (`the supplement group of` `an Oz LeTmura principal`) (Date 1 3 2020) EQUALS JUST 1025.19
#ASSERT `monthly shekel supplement 2016` `Oz LeTmura teacher` (Date 1 10 2020) EQUALS JUST 1282.69
#ASSERT `monthly shekel supplement 2016` `Oz LeTmura teacher` (Date 1 12 2019) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `monthly difference owed for January to August 2020` `Oz LeTmura teacher` EQUALS 88.21
#ASSERT `monthly difference owed for January to August 2020` `non-reform teacher or principal` EQUALS 86.92
#ASSERT `entitled to the '87 transition supplement` `an Oz LeTmura principal`
#ASSERT NOT `entitled to the '87 transition supplement` `an Oz LeTmura teacher`
#ASSERT `monthly '87 transition supplement` (Date 1 2 2020) EQUALS JUST 1024.73

-- The '87 supplement's own update is the one part a single linkage factor
-- explains: about +0.6%.
#EVAL `monthly '87 transition supplement` (Date 1 2 2020)
#EVAL 1024.73 DIVIDED BY `the '87 supplement paid before this update`

-- Time in months from January 2020: paid at the updated amount, the duty is
-- met; paid at the old amount, it is still owed (the circular sets no deadline).
#TRACE `paying the updated supplement` `an Oz LeTmura teacher` (Date 1 3 2020) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the updated supplement` 1242.05 AT 1
#TRACE `paying the updated supplement` `an Oz LeTmura teacher` (Date 1 3 2020) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the updated supplement` 1153.84 AT 1
